Subject: [PATCH 3/4] test(claude-eval): G256-4/5 passage identity and
 projection races

point_id validates its fields and serializes them as JSON (no separator
ambiguity). Superseded or revoked projections are kept but not served, so
they cannot fill the candidate limit. Probe kills a surviving mutant: an
out-of-bounds passage must be excluded, not fail the whole recall.

